WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The Truth of Minab — A Field Documentary by Javad Mogoei (War Chronicles Episode 13).

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:16.500
Documentary filmmaker Javad Mogoei arrives on site in Minab to meet families and surviving educators.

3
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Eyewitness testimonies detail the sequence between the first blast and the secondary impact.

4
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Mothers recount rushing to the school gate to rescue their daughters, only to be struck in the second explosion.

5
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:44.000
The voices of Minab speak directly to the world, demanding truth, memory, and justice.

